 curity-snapshot/blob/main/config/exploratory.yaml. Findings go to the 12 N
 ov research review\; any source that holds up becomes active before the 29
  Dec freeze. Also the X12 amendment of 26 Oct (open-weight release rate): 
 Hugging Face Hub API by lab\, Epoch AI's model database\, and candidate be
 nchmarks for the "capable" bar.\n\nSource: https://github.com/pagagne/inte
