TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
SUMMARY:[Claude] Snapshot: Send the reviewer the Q1 2027 review packet
DESCRIPTION:Responsible: Claude\n\nOnce the provisional Q1 2027 report is a
 pproved: links to the report\, the registered plan\, https://github.com/pa
 gagne/internet-security-snapshot/blob/main/prereg/DEVIATIONS.md\, the data
  bundle and the exact code commit\; the worksheet for every headline figur
 e\; the sample of hand decisions with their rules\; a short review templat
 e (holds up / doesn't / would change). Before sending\, list in https://gi
 thub.com/pagagne/internet-security-snapshot/blob/main/site/reviewer/worksh
 eets.json ("draw_from") the headline figures actually reported this quarte
 r and add their worksheets\; the reviewer draws three on the Reviewer's De
 sk with a seed of their own (anyone can repeat it). Never choose the figur
 es.\n\nReviewer's Desk (tasks\, worksheets\, second-coder rounds): https:/
 /pagagne.github.io/internet-security-snapshot/reviewer/ (live from 4 Dec 2
 026)\n\nSource: https://github.com/pagagne/internet-security-snapshot/blob
 /main/docs/schedule/schedule.yaml
