UID:external-review@2027-04-03@internet-security-snapshot
DTSTAMP:20261024T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270403
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270429
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
SUMMARY:[Reviewer] Snapshot: Independent review of the Q1 2027 provisional 
 report
DESCRIPTION:Responsible: Reviewer (external reviewer)\n\nAbout 8-12 hours. 
 Read the provisional Q1 2027 report against the registered plan and the de
 viations log\; spot-check three headline figures drawn at random (from a s
 eed you choose) plus any you pick\, recomputing each from its worksheet in
  a spreadsheet (no programming needed)\; look at the sample of hand decisi
 ons and their written rules. Send a short written review (two to five page
 s: what holds up\, what doesn't\, what you'd change) by 28 April. The wind
 ow can move a week or two if needed\; publication is 1 May.\n\nReviewer's 
 Desk (tasks\, worksheets\, second-coder rounds): https://pagagne.github.io
 /internet-security-snapshot/reviewer/ (live from 4 Dec 2026)\n\nSource: ht
 tps://github.com/pagagne/internet-security-snapshot/blob/main/docs/schedul
 e/schedule.yaml
CATEGORIES:External reviewer
END:VEVENT
