 to claude/private-data-copy.md. Large bundles (runs/\, repository/) stay i
 n Drive and GitHub only\; the inventory records their checksums. Never cop
 y into the repository.\n\nSource: https://github.com/pagagne/internet-secu
 rity-snapshot/blob/main/docs/schedule/schedule.yaml
CATEGORIES:Claude
END:VEVENT
