 n/config/exploratory.yaml for reports dated in the quarter just ended. Log
  every candidate in https://github.com/pagagne/internet-security-snapshot/
 blob/main/exploratory/ai_attack_sweeps.csv (kept or excluded\, with the re
 ason) and add the kept ones to https://github.com/pagagne/internet-securit
 y-snapshot/blob/main/exploratory/ai_attack_campaigns.csv marked for the au
 thor's check. Finds incidents reported outside the AI-lab and vendor chann
 els\; it cannot find what nobody reports.\n\nSource: https://github.com/pa
 gagne/internet-security-snapshot/blob/main/docs/schedule/schedule.yaml
