DTEND:20280315T163000Z
SUMMARY:[Paul] Snapshot: Annual review and change window
DESCRIPTION:Responsible: Paul (author)\n\nThe one time each year core rules
  may change (https://github.com/pagagne/internet-security-snapshot/blob/ma
 in/docs/CHANGE_POLICY.md). Promotion candidates\; the AI-credit rule\; the
  inquiry log (https://github.com/pagagne/internet-security-snapshot/blob/m
 ain/docs/INQUIRIES.md) and the year's exploratory additions\; the year's f
 our AI-attack sweeps compared (what each found that the usual channels mis
 sed\, and incidents reported late)\; any change run side by side for four 
 quarters. From 2028 (the annual wrap-up): review the annual check of the p
 revious year's free results against reference scan data and published insu
 rance-claims and ransom-payment figures (pre-registration section 13)\, an
 d approve it for publishing.\n\nSource: https://github.com/pagagne/interne
 t-security-snapshot/blob/main/docs/schedule/schedule.yaml
CATEGORIES:Author
END:VEVENT
